	"data": "MEXT Scholarship — Comprehensive Guide\n\nEverything about the MEXT (Monbukagakusho) Scholarship in one place:\neligibility, routes, timeline, dual-MEXT specifics, visa details,\nfinancial planning, and strategic decisions.\nWhat MEXT Covers\n\n| Benefit | Details |\n|---------|---------|\n| Full tuition | Entrance exam, matriculation, and tuition fees all waived |\n| Monthly stipend | ¥144,000/mo (Master's) / ¥145,000/mo (Doctoral) as of 2026; ¥2,000–¥3,000 regional supplement for designated areas |\n|…",
